"label_theme": "", "text_color": "", "bg_style": 0, "bg_color": "", "border_color": "", "use_img_label": true, "img_label_uri_hans": "", "img_label_uri_hant": "", "img_label_uri_hans_static": "https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/vip/d7b702ef65a976b20ed854cbd04cb9e27341bb79.png", "img_label_uri_hant_static": "https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/activity-plat/static/20220614/e369244d0b14644f5e1a06431e22a4d5/KJunwh19T5.png"}, "avatar_subscript": 0, "nickname_color": "", "role": "0", "avatar_subscript_url": "", "tv_vip_status": 0, "tv_vip_pay_type": 0, "tv_due_date": "0", "avatar_icon": {"icon_type": 0, "icon_resource": {"type": 0, "url": ""}}}, "official_verify": {"type": -1, "desc": ""}, "decorate": null, "decoration_card": null, "is_top": false, "icon_badge": null}, "module_more": {"rcmd_text": "", "three_point_items": [{"label": "举报", "type": "THREE_POINT_REPORT", "params": {}, "modal": null, "jump_url": ""}]}, "module_dispute": null, "module_dynamic": {"topic": null, "desc": null, "major": {"type": "MAJOR_TYPE_OPUS", "none": null, "blocked": null, "archive": null, "pgc": null, "courses": null, "draw": null, "article": null, "music": null, "common": null, "upower_common": null, "live": null, "live_rcmd": null, "medialist": null, "subscription": null, "ugc_season": null, "subscription_new": null, "opus": {"jump_url": "//www.bilibili.com/opus/1204715666309906467", "title": "5.21日：午评！", "summary": {"text": "指数今天一度上涨30多个点，随后出现回落，个股涨跌数量也一样。目前在60分已经呈现出清晰的上三，那便还是那句话，勿以涨喜，勿以跌悲，不然后面你会被行情反复戏弄。\n \n板块方面，今天轮动分化开始逐步明显，半导体这里开始出现些许回调需求，券商、医疗医药、消费电子、机器人、汽车被轮动到，能源类领跌。\n \n有意思的是逆子在狂喜一天之后给了板，但思路昨天花了非常大的篇幅讲技术，相信大家都明白原理。\n \n其它就没什么了，大体思路都在前瞻预期内，没太多可讲的，这也是今天没发早报的原因。可以这么说，如果皓哥没法早报，大概率就是没啥讲的，前几天任何一天的早报都可以当做今天的。\n...", "rich_text_nodes": [{"text": "指数今天一度上涨30多个点，随后出现回落，个股涨跌数量也一样。目前在60分已经呈现出清晰的上三，那便还是那句话，勿以涨喜，勿以跌悲，不然后面你会被行情反复戏弄。", "orig_text": "指数今天一度上涨30多个点，随后出现回落，个股涨跌数量也一样。目前在60分已经呈现出清晰的上三，那便还是那句话，勿以涨喜，勿以跌悲，不然后面你会被行情反复戏弄。", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "\n", "orig_text": "\n", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": " ", "orig_text": " ", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "\n", "orig_text": "\n", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "板块方面，今天轮动分化开始逐步明显，半导体这里开始出现些许回调需求，券商、医疗医药、消费电子、机器人、汽车被轮动到，能源类领跌。", "orig_text": "板块方面，今天轮动分化开始逐步明显，半导体这里开始出现些许回调需求，券商、医疗医药、消费电子、机器人、汽车被轮动到，能源类领跌。", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "\n", "orig_text": "\n", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": " ", "orig_text": " ", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "\n", "orig_text": "\n", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "有意思的是逆子在狂喜一天之后给了板，但思路昨天花了非常大的篇幅讲技术，相信大家都明白原理。", "orig_text": "有意思的是逆子在狂喜一天之后给了板，但思路昨天花了非常大的篇幅讲技术，相信大家都明白原理。", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "\n", "orig_text": "\n", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "ic