", "label_theme": "", "text_color": "", "bg_style": 0, "bg_color": "", "border_color": "", "use_img_label": true, "img_label_uri_hans": "", "img_label_uri_hant": "", "img_label_uri_hans_static": "https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/vip/d7b702ef65a976b20ed854cbd04cb9e27341bb79.png", "img_label_uri_hant_static": "https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/activity-plat/static/20220614/e369244d0b14644f5e1a06431e22a4d5/KJunwh19T5.png"}, "avatar_subscript": 0, "nickname_color": "", "role": "0", "avatar_subscript_url": "", "tv_vip_status": 0, "tv_vip_pay_type": 0, "tv_due_date": "0", "avatar_icon": {"icon_type": 0, "icon_resource": {"type": 0, "url": ""}}}, "official_verify": {"type": -1, "desc": ""}, "decorate": null, "decoration_card": null, "is_top": false, "icon_badge": null}, "module_more": {"rcmd_text": "", "three_point_items": [{"label": "举报", "type": "THREE_POINT_REPORT", "params": {}, "modal": null, "jump_url": ""}]}, "module_dispute": null, "module_dynamic": {"topic": null, "desc": null, "major": {"type": "MAJOR_TYPE_OPUS", "none": null, "blocked": null, "archive": null, "pgc": null, "courses": null, "draw": null, "article": null, "music": null, "common": null, "upower_common": null, "live": null, "live_rcmd": null, "medialist": null, "subscription": null, "ugc_season": null, "subscription_new": null, "opus": {"jump_url": "//www.bilibili.com/opus/1202538126463991808", "title": "5.15日：盘中！", "summary": {"text": "指数真惨，午前稍稍修复，马上又开始跳水。\n \n也对，调整就是调整，你管它如何调整呢，耐心等待调整完毕，再找机会干即可。今天来说避风港其实不多，AI硬件也在调。\n \n不过4月22日提的硬件标的以及后续提的机器人非常强，仍然大涨，逆子也是避风港，没啥说的，喝茶等待吧。\n \n不必心急，认准手里的方向，让市场自己折腾，差不多，我继续给机会！\n \n惯例提示：以上仅为个人不成熟观点，能力有限，因此不作为投资建议！", "rich_text_nodes": [{"text": "指数真惨，午前稍稍修复，马上又开始跳水。", "orig_text": "指数真惨，午前稍稍修复，马上又开始跳水。", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "\n", "orig_text": "\n", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": " ", "orig_text": " ", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "\n", "orig_text": "\n", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "也对，调整就是调整，你管它如何调整呢，耐心等待调整完毕，再找机会干即可。今天来说避风港其实不多，AI硬件也在调。", "orig_text": "也对，调整就是调整，你管它如何调整呢，耐心等待调整完毕，再找机会干即可。今天来说避风港其实不多，AI硬件也在调。", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "\n", "orig_text": "\n", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": " ", "orig_text": " ", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "\n", "orig_text": "\n", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "不过4月22日提的硬件标的以及后续提的机器人非常强，仍然大涨，逆子也是避风港，没啥说的，喝茶等待吧。", "orig_text": "不过4月22日提的硬件标的以及后续提的机器人非常强，仍然大涨，逆子也是避风港，没啥说的，喝茶等待吧。", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": "\n", "orig_text": "\n", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_url": "", "icon_name": "", "rid": "", "emoji": null, "goods": null, "style": null, "pics": [], "video": null}, {"text": " ", "orig_text": " ", "type": "RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TEXT", "jump_url": "", "icon_ur